        "number": "19",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1CH 19"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "19",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tauti Arakëra Abhaamoni na Abhaasuru",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano gayö gahetërë Nahasi, ömögambi wa Abhaamoni agakua; ömoona waae akabha ömögambi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono, Tauti akabhööra iga, “Nëndakorre Hanuni ömoona o Nahasi amaiya, kugira ninyoora ni isawaabho nankoreeyë amaiya.” Igo Tauti agatöma abhantö kuya kömöhonia kuruku ro isawaabho. Nabho bhakaya o Hanuni iga korri bhamöhoni, gönsë ëyö ya Abhaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono abhatangati bha Abhaamoni bhagateebhia ömögambi iga, “Gösë! Nökanyërë iga ngikugira yu ubhusuuki bho isaweinyu Tauti atömërë abhantö bhano guucha gököhonia? Abhantö bhano tabhanyunkinyunki bhano bhatömëröe gucha guisuncha ënsë, kögëhenyahenya na kugisikia?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono Hanuni akaimukia abhakoramërëmo bhayö bha Tauti, akabhagingira öröka na götandörra ichingëbhö chaabho gataigatai kuhika kömatörö, sooki akabharichokia bhagende, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nabho bhagatanöra kuringa waabho. Hano Tauti ateebhibhöe keebhörë abhantö bhaae bhakorröë, naatömërë abhantö köbhaturung'ana kugira mbaagotëröë ni inchisoni bhökong'u. Ömögambi nawe akabhateebhia iga, “Ikara kumugi go Yeriko, kuhika ichinka chainyu chimere, nëho muringë.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Abhaamoni bharööchë iga bhagirre Tauti bharegërë, Hanuni na Abhaamoni mbaatömërë abhantö Mesobhotamia, Aramaaka, na Sobha, kuhira ichitaranta chi amatiini gi ichimbiria ibhiköë bhinai (4,000), köhakanëra amagari na abhagendia-bharaasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbaahakanëëyë amagari ibhiköë mërongo ëtatö na bhëbhërë (32,000) nö ömögambi wa Maaka na abhasirikare bhaae, agaacha na götööra irisanchö hang'i na Metebha. Abhaamoni bhakairania kurua kumigi geebho gionsui, bhagaiseemia guitana iriihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tauti nawe hano aiguure igo naatömërë Yoabhu na iricheesi rionsui ria abhakarë. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaamoni bhakarichoka bhagakora öröhari kuiihita riu umugi, na haara abhagambi bhaara wanyoorrë bhachërë bharëngë abhiene kögëtörare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Yoabhu arööche iga iriihi ni iririto harë we akaahöra abhasirikare abhaitani ibhihubheebhe bha Abhaisiraeri, akabhasemiria keebhörë bharasiorani na Abhaasami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abhaanacheesi bhandë bhaara bhaatamërë naabhatörrë köbhötangati bho Abhisai mura omoobho, nawe akabhaseemia korri bhatangerrani na Abhaamoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yoabhu agateebhia abhisai iga, “Hano ndanyoore Abhaasami mbhankëra ichinguru, nörantuurri; na hano ndanyoore Abhaamoni mbhagökëra ichinguru, nëndaache kugutuurria. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono tatërëmëka! Tuitane gësaacha kugira ya abhantö bhaitö, na gikugira yi imigi gë Ënooköë weitö; ÖMÖNENE atökorrë rëra akömaaha iga ni inchiiya harë bhaitö.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bhoono Yoabhu na abhantö bhaae bhakaya mbere guitana na Abhaasami; Abhaasami bhagakëröa bhakang'osa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Abhaamoni bharööchë Abhaasami bhang'osërë, nabho mbaang'osërë Abhisai, mura omoobho Yoabhu, bhagasoha kumugi. Nëho Yoabhu aaringërë Yerusaremu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono Abhaasami hano bhaaröchë iga bhakërröë na Abhaisiraeri, mbaatömërë abhantö kuya köbhërëkëra Abhaasami bhaandë bhano bhaarëngë ihumbu yö ömooro Yubhurati bharatangatöa na Sobhaki, ömökönaare wi iricheesi re Hatateseri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hano Tauti aigurë igo, nakömërë hamui Abhaisiraeri bhonsui, akaröbhöka ömooro go Yorotani, akabhagëëra, agaseemia amacheesi gaae götangërrania nabho. Hano Tauti aiseemiri guitania Abhaasami, bhoono nabho bhagaitana nawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sibhoono Abhaasami bhagakëröa bhakang'osa Abhaisiraeri. Tauti naitërë Abhaasami abhagendia bha amagari ibhiköë muhungatë (7,000) na abhasirikare bha amagörö ibhiköë mërongo ënai (40,000). Guiki naitërë Sobhaki, ömökönaare wi iricheesi reebho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na hano abhakoramërëmo bha Hatateseri bharöchë iga bhakërröë na Abhaisiraeri, mbaakörrë ubhuiguërranio bhö ömörembe na Tauti nabho bhakabha abhagöre bha Tauti. Bhöyö mbe Abhaasami tebhaitabhiriiyi gutuurria Abhaamoni guiki röndë hai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.19.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
